          deckDescription: 'A 32-card stripped French deck: remove all 8s, 9s, and 10s from a standard 52-card pack, leaving Ace, King, Queen, Jack, 7, 6, 5, 4, 3, 2 in each suit. Used for Hurrikan and similar Central European point-trick games.',
